─── SOH / NATIVE MEANING EQUATIONS ───
Μ(CENTERED_Z) = S - 1/2
Μ(J_Z) = -CONJUGATE(CENTERED_Z)
Μ(CHANNEL_TRANSFORM_h) = INTEGRAL[u=-INFINITY..INFINITY](h(u)*EXP(CENTERED_Z*u) du)
